---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro"
---
<section id="measurement" class="measurement-section" aria-labelledby="measurement-title">
  <div class="method-caption"><h2>Measurement model</h2><p>Four counters, from original body to relay cache.</p></div>
  <div class="measurement-method-grid">
    <article class="panel method-card">
      <span class="method-icon"><Icon name="activity" size={18} /></span>
      <h2>Original body</h2>
      <p>Decoded request-body bytes read by the chunker, before chunking or upload compression. If the incoming request was gzip-encoded, this is after gateway decoding. It is the <span class="data-value">100%</span> baseline.</p>
      <code class="method-code">body_bytes</code>
    </article>
    <article class="panel method-card">
      <span class="method-icon"><Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></span>
      <h2>Encoded upload</h2>
      <p>Selected RPC request-body bytes consumed by the Go transport: manifests, dispatch, chunk framing, gzip when smaller, and retries. Not packet capture or proof of relay receipt; headers and responses are excluded.</p>
      <code class="method-code">request_body_bytes_sent</code>
    </article>
    <article class="panel method-card">
      <span class="method-icon"><Icon name="download" size={18} /></span>
      <h2>Saved / reduction</h2>
      <p>Failed and cancelled attempts remain included, and small calls or retries can produce negative savings.</p>
      <code class="method-code">body_bytes − request_body_bytes_sent</code>
    </article>
    <article class="panel method-card">
      <span class="method-icon"><Icon name="bolt" size={18} /></span>
      <h2>Content reuse</h2>
      <p>Body bytes already present in the relay cache at inventory time. This is not provider token/KV-cache reuse and does not promise a provider-billing discount.</p>
      <code class="method-code">reused_body_bytes</code>
    </article>
  </div>

  <article class="panel measurement-formulas" aria-labelledby="measurement-formulas-title">
    <div class="measurement-formulas-head">
      <h2 id="measurement-formulas-title">How savings are calculated</h2>
      <p>Both results compare the encoded upload against the original decoded body. A negative result means the upload was larger.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="measurement-formulas-grid">
      <div>
        <h3>Saved bytes</h3>
        <div class="equation-block">
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><mrow><mtext>Saved</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>original</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>encoded</mi></mrow></math>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Upload reduction</h3>
        <div class="equation-block">
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><mrow><mtext>Reduction</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>encoded</mi><mi>original</mi></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>%</mo></mrow></math>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="panel measurement-trace-panel">
    <div class="measurement-toolbar">
      <div>
        <h2>Trace a measured session</h2>
        <p>Browse sessions stored by OpenCode or retained by the gateway. Only sessions with gateway measurements can be traced; then pick a request for its body-to-wire evidence. Payloads are available only when explicitly captured.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="measurement-picker">
        <span class="measurement-picker-label" id="measurement-session-label">Session</span>
        <button class="measurement-session-trigger" id="measurement-session-trigger" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-labelledby="measurement-session-label measurement-session-trigger-title" disabled>
          <span class="measurement-session-trigger-copy">
            <span class="measurement-session-trigger-title" id="measurement-session-trigger-title">Waiting for local gateway…</span>
            <span class="measurement-session-trigger-meta" id="measurement-session-trigger-meta"></span>
          </span>
          <span class="measurement-session-trigger-action">Browse</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="measurement-trace" id="measurement-trace"></div>
    <section class="request-inspector" id="request-inspector" aria-label="Selected request evidence"></section>
    <div class="measurement-retention" id="retention-note"><dl class="data-facts"><div><dt>Gateway session limit</dt><dd>256</dd></div><div><dt>Request limit</dt><dd>1,000</dd></div><div><dt>Hourly aggregates</dt><dd>31 days</dd></div><div><dt>Daily aggregates</dt><dd>91 days</dd></div></dl><p>Global totals are preserved. Earlier gateway history is not imported from logs.</p></div>
  </article>

  <dialog id="measurement-session-dialog" class="session-dialog session-browser-dialog" aria-labelledby="measurement-session-dialog-title">
    <div class="dialog-heading session-browser-heading">
      <div>
        <h2 id="measurement-session-dialog-title">Choose a session</h2>
        <p id="measurement-session-dialog-summary">All sessions stored by OpenCode. Only sessions with gateway measurements can be traced.</p>
      </div>
      <button class="icon-button" id="close-measurement-session" type="button" aria-label="Close session browser"><Icon name="close" /></button>
    </div>
    <div class="session-browser-toolbar">
      <div class="search-field">
        <Icon name="search" size={17} />
        <label class="sr-only" for="measurement-session-search">Search stored sessions</label>
        <input id="measurement-session-search" name="measurement-session-search" type="search" placeholder="Search title, ID, project, or model…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="200" />
      </div>
      <label class="session-browser-filter">Day <select id="measurement-session-day" name="measurement-session-day"><option value="">All days</option></select></label>
      <label class="session-browser-filter">Show <select id="measurement-session-availability" name="measurement-session-availability"><option value="all">All stored sessions</option><option value="measured">Measured only</option></select></label>
      <div class="compact-sort session-browser-sort" id="measurement-session-sort-controls">
        <label class="compact-sort-field"><span>Sort</span><select id="measurement-session-sort" aria-label="Sort sessions by">
          <option value="updated">Updated</option>
          <option value="session">Session</option>
          <option value="started">Started</option>
          <option value="provider">Provider</option>
          <option value="requests">Requests</option>
          <option value="reduction">Reduction</option>
          <option value="status">Status</option>
        </select></label>
        <button class="compact-sort-direction" id="measurement-session-sort-direction" type="button" aria-label="Sort direction: descending" title="Reverse sort direction"><Icon name="chevron" size={12} /></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="session-browser-notice" id="measurement-session-notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    <div class="session-browser-scroll" id="measurement-session-scroll">
      <table class="session-browser-table">
        <caption class="sr-only">Sessions stored by OpenCode, with gateway measurement availability. Sortable column headers are available on wide screens; a sort control is available on narrow screens.</caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" data-sort-key="session" aria-sort="none"><button class="table-sort" type="button" data-sort-key="session" data-sort-label="session"><span>Session</span><span class="sort-indicator" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-up" /><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-down" /></span></button></th>
            <th scope="col" data-sort-key="started" aria-sort="none"><button class="table-sort" type="button" data-sort-key="started" data-sort-label="started date"><span>Started</span><span class="sort-indicator" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-up" /><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-down" /></span></button></th>
            <th scope="col" data-sort-key="provider" aria-sort="none"><button class="table-sort" type="button" data-sort-key="provider" data-sort-label="provider"><span>Provider</span><span class="sort-indicator" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-up" /><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-down" /></span></button></th>
            <th scope="col" class="number" data-sort-key="requests" aria-sort="none"><button class="table-sort" type="button" data-sort-key="requests" data-sort-label="requests"><span>Requests</span><span class="sort-indicator" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-up" /><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-down" /></span></button></th>
            <th scope="col" class="number" data-sort-key="reduction" aria-sort="none"><button class="table-sort" type="button" data-sort-key="reduction" data-sort-label="reduction"><span>Reduction</span><span class="sort-indicator" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-up" /><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-down" /></span></button></th>
            <th scope="col" data-sort-key="status" aria-sort="none"><button class="table-sort" type="button" data-sort-key="status" data-sort-label="status"><span>Status</span><span class="sort-indicator" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-up" /><Icon name="chevron" size={8} class="sort-down" /></span></button></th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="measurement-session-rows"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="empty-state session-browser-empty" id="measurement-session-empty" hidden><h3>No matching sessions</h3><p>Change the search, day, or availability filter.</p></div>
    <div class="table-footer session-browser-footer">
      <span id="measurement-session-summary" role="status" aria-live="polite">0 sessions</span>
      <div class="pagination">
        <button class="text-button" id="measurement-session-previous" type="button" aria-label="Previous session page" disabled>Previous</button>
        <span id="measurement-session-page">Page 1 of 1</span>
        <button class="text-button" id="measurement-session-next" type="button" aria-label="Next session page" disabled>Next</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <p class="measurement-footnote"><Icon name="info" size={14} /> Saved bytes compare request bodies, not provider billing. Responses, HTTP/TLS headers, TLS/TCP/IP overhead, and retransmissions are outside these counters.</p>
</section>
